## **HTML Button with CSS Styling**
```html
<button class="btn">Click Me</button>

<style>
  .btn {
    background-color: #4CAF50;
    color: white;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background-color: #45a049;
  }
</style>
```

