## **React Button**
```jsx
function MyButton() {
  const handleClick = () => {
    alert("Button clicked!");
  };

  return <button onClick={handleClick}>Click Me</button>;
}
```

---

## **Python (Tkinter) Button**
```python
import tkinter as tk

root = tk.Tk()
button = tk.Button(root, text="Click Me", command=lambda: print("Clicked!"))
button.pack()
root.mainloop()
```

